   in the concrete form `𝒜(D') = 𝒜(D) + B(D')`.  This is exactly the `htwist`
   datum of the χ-ledger (`chi_add`), unwound;
3. **the closed ledger** `χ(D) = χ(0) + deg_k D`, used only to produce an
   effective witness in the class of `D − D₀`.
